Falling Into a Black Hole — Pictogram Motion (Lemo-Opuscar)
A 30-second style sample: the same black-hole story told in flat pictogram shapes on colour discs.
All drawings, lettering layout, animation, sound effects and music are original and generated by code in this folder.

MUSIC (music/score.py, original composition, D minor)
Marimba, vibes, bass, glass, cellos, glockenspiel (sample-based, synthesised offline).

SOUND EFFECTS
Synthesised in mix.py with numpy / core/audio/sfx.py.

VOICE
Kokoro-82M (Apache-2.0) via kokoro-onnx, voice bm_george (en-us).

FONTS (SIL Open Font License 1.1, OFL files in fonts/)
Inter Tight (display) · DM Mono (labels and HUD).

PHYSICS FACTS
Event horizon, spaghettification and gravitational time dilation after standard general-relativity
descriptions (e.g. LIGO Scientific Collaboration public materials).
